            "notes": "## Round 1\n[Bango!](item_b48a6731-fae8-4732-aae0-ceffbf324235) is the core of this build and should be your round 1 power. It is also great at cash generation.  \nUsually I would prefer [Power Playbook](item_6d8803cf-baa7-46ee-af91-51e7f2301418) because it gives a higher percentage bonus to all your other abilities and [Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0) doesn't change any breakpoints, even with [Bango!](item_b48a6731-fae8-4732-aae0-ceffbf324235). However I've seen a lot of other people pick [Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0) for the increase cash generation and tank pressure potential so I'm currently testing it in this build.\n\nAs always your goal should be first and foremost: cash generation.",
