            "notes": "## Round 3\nWe choose either [Slapnel](item_960e424b-3533-46b1-8063-11b575225647) or [It's A(nother) Trap!](item_850f4701-cb41-4083-ba0e-7f96b6757025) as they both give us another ability charge. [Slapnel](item_960e424b-3533-46b1-8063-11b575225647) is preferred as the cooldown is separate from Steel Trap.\n\nOriginally we'd pick up [Mark of the Kitsune](item_09a53e39-25aa-4f66-ba51-bedbc543a1eb) and [Three-tap Tommygun](item_39c5d2a4-1db0-444f-86d9-2a1e9a331429) this round but there just isn't enough cash and stats to justify it so I've moved it back some rounds.  \nInstead we continue to focus on Weapon Power and Attack Speed.  \n\nCurrently testing [Spiked Gloves](item_70573d1b-b952-4418-a13f-5728ff472a07). The 10% extra damage isn't calculated using the base damage but instead the Weapon Power modified damage.  \nDamage calculations, excluding [Bango!](item_b48a6731-fae8-4732-aae0-ceffbf324235) damage (I need to figure out this interaction):\n- 35% WP: - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - -168.75 damage\n- 25% WP + 10% aerial damage: - - - 171.875 damage (only if the target is in air)",
